#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're no stranger to thrusting your sword through zombies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're able to gore someone on your sword like a pro."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're a virtuoso with your sword, ready to deliver a swift and deadly "
"thrust."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to swing a longsword without chopping off your own foot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're proficient with the use of long swords, and are deadly with one in "
"your hands."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You are a blade master of unparalleled skill.  And they said anime wasn't "
"real."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You are able to operate your bionic sword without incident."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your bionic sword proficiency is satisfactory.  You are able to use it "
"without discomfort."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your capabilities with your bionic sword is the epitome of combat efficiency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've learned how to hit your opponent instead of yourself with your flail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to swing your flail with deadly precision, crushing through ribs "
"and skulls alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You can make your flail dance like a ballerina, and hit like a truck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mace Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've got the gist of bludgeoning your enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mace Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You swing your mace with dead efficiency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mace Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Your strikes with a mace shatter skulls and pulp brains."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're not afraid to lift a heavy sword nor bring it down on someone's head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You are not afraid to swing big with a heavy sword."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You wield your blade like it was a modern day Caliburn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You can handle a big ol' hammer without dropping it on your toes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're not afraid to put some muscle into it when you're swinging a hammer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're a hammering juggernaut, ready to smash it all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're not quite a professional lumberjack, but you can handle an axe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You chop through bodies as easily as you chop through trees."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're a post-apocalyptic Paul Bunyan, but it's not just wood you're "
"chopping."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know the proper technique to use with a hand axe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to use a hatchet safely and effectively."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're more than capable of using a hand axe to protect yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to punch someone without hurting your wrists."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to pace yourself when you've got nothing else to fight with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're used to fighting with nothing and can fight unarmed for longer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Whip Familiarity"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Whip Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You can crack a whip without hurting yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Whip Proficiency"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Whip Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You can use a whip to snuff out a candle from across the room without "
"touching the wax."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Whip Mastery"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Whip Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your skill at hunting the living dead with a whip is unparalleled.  Make the "
"Belmonts proud."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Principles of Redsmithing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Redsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of the techniques required to work with copper and "
"bronze, soft metals require a somewhat different kind of skill set than "
"blacksmithing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Advanced Redsmithing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Advanced Redsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"You can now easily work with the more ductile copper-containing metals and "
"could probably make a living in the Bronze Age."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Quenching & Tempering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"Quenching involves heating the steel, quenching it in water, then tempering "
"it to create extremely tough metal."
msgstr ""

